# How many supplier sites one sourcing request drives at once. Its real ceiling
# is the Browserbase plan's concurrent-browser cap (3 Free, 25 Developer) — over
# it, the session create fails outright rather than queueing. A request has at
# most four sites, so raising this past 4 does nothing; the number of requests
# in flight is what fills a plan (frontend PREFETCH_PARALLEL).
SOURCING_DISCOVERY_CONCURRENCY=3
